{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"crates/clax-embedded/src/web.rs","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-17T16:17:21.791851Z","id":"18a17bfd2f3020a29a7af93613b4ff500ae5d7e258742fd1f9c862d139a9ad0b","body":{"kind":"resolve","ref":"git:4226f1128","summary":"Fixed in 4226f1128: the tests module itself is #[cfg(all(test, any(not(debug_assertions), clax_embedded)))], so a debug build that does not embed compiles no module and no import. Evidence: just lint-native (cargo clippy --workspace --all-targets -- -D warnings, then cargo clippy --workspace -- -D warnings, then the web lint) exit 0, no 'unused import' in its log; bazel build --config=clippy //crates/clax-embedded/... exit 0; bazel test //crates/clax-embedded/... PASSED with web::tests::an_embedded_build_carries_the_bridge ... ok.","supersedes":"5a32e49d3de9d301e26762029d07e72566987dfbbefd27d130d83450361bf033","tags":["reason:fixed","session:claude-code:6847a238-376f-486d-8e40-4d0fa676e347"]}}
